(ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE OVERVIEW) '
T*
(Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines.) '
(The goal of AI is to develop systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human cognition,) '
(such as visual perception, speech recognition, decision-making, and language translation.) '
T*
(Machine Learning is a subset of AI that focuses on building applications that learn from data and improve) '
(their accuracy over time without being explicitly programmed to do so.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
