(DEEP LEARNING AND NEURAL NETWORKS) '
T*
(Deep Learning is a specialized subfield of Machine Learning based on Artificial Neural Networks with representation learning.) '
(The term deep refers to the number of layers in the network.) '
(A typical deep neural network consists of an input layer, multiple hidden layers, and an output layer.) '
T*
(Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNNs\) excel at image processing, while Recurrent Neural Networks \(RNNs\) and) '
(Transformers are designed for sequential data and natural language processing.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
